time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        This function attempts to dynamically load a class which"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        implements the specified rdata class and type.  If there is no"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        class-and-type-specific implementation, the GenericRdata class"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        is used."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        Once a class is chosen, its from_text() class method is called"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        with the parameters to this function."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        If *tok* is a ``str``, then a tokenizer is created and the string"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        is used as its input."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *rdclass*, a ``dns.rdataclass.RdataClass`` or ``str``, the rdataclass."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *rdtype*, a ``dns.rdatatype.RdataType`` or ``str``, the rdatatype."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *tok*, a ``dns.tokenizer.Tokenizer`` or a ``str``."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *origin*, a ``dns.name.Name`` (or ``None``), the"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        origin to use for relative names."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *relativize*, a ``bool``.  If true, name will be relativized."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *relativize_to*, a ``dns.name.Name`` (or ``None``), the origin to use"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        when relativizing names.  If not set, the *origin* value will be used."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        *idna_codec*, a ``dns.name.IDNACodec``, specifies the IDNA"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        encoder/decoder to use if a tokenizer needs to be created.  If"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        ``None``, the default IDNA 2003 encoder/decoder is used.  If a"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        tokenizer is not created, then the codec associated with the tokenizer"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        is the one that is used."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        Returns an instance of the chosen Rdata subclass."
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="    "
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        \"\"\""
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        if isinstance(tok, str):"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="            tok = dns.tokenizer.Tokenizer(tok, idna_codec=idna_codec)"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        rdclass = dns.rdataclass.RdataClass.make(rdclass)"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        rdtype = dns.rdatatype.RdataType.make(rdtype)"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        cls = get_rdata_class(rdclass, rdtype)"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="        with dns.exception.ExceptionWrapper(dns.exception.SyntaxError):"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="            rdata = None"
time="2025-03-18T17:41:23Z" level=debug msg="            if cls != GenericRdata:"
